  "prefLabel": "Per 102.44 Human resources management system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.44 “Human resources management system” means the statewide electronic system of record used by the state to track human resources functions such as recruitment, hiring, compensation, and other matters addressed in these rules.\n\nSource. #10238, eff 3-18-13; renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.32); renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.33); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.37), eff 12-1-25",
